            {
                "entry_id": "ec336316-36e5-3fc8-aafa-c925bf61e72d",
                "word": "fléchette",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0d726d09-58a4-40bb-b3a0-7b28814e8af9",
                        "entry_id": "ec336316-36e5-3fc8-aafa-c925bf61e72d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "fléchettes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "73f2f40f-12b4-3692-a99d-d39dcadf69ec",
                        "entry_id": "ec336316-36e5-3fc8-aafa-c925bf61e72d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Petite flèche."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "103b9e6f-cadd-4d97-8580-11b49b94461a",
                                "sense_id": "73f2f40f-12b4-3692-a99d-d39dcadf69ec",
                                "text": "Tu n’as plus qu’à tirer à l’arc ou à la fléchette empoisonnée."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df974b07-ba03-4e9a-a75f-37ffd7b9c515",
                                "sense_id": "73f2f40f-12b4-3692-a99d-d39dcadf69ec",
                                "text": "Sans discontinuer, les joueurs, quasi en déséquilibre pour accompagner au mieux les fléchettes, n’ont de regard que pour la cible."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "471ade73-fc54-4b36-993a-32dadfd281ab",
                                "sense_id": "73f2f40f-12b4-3692-a99d-d39dcadf69ec",
                                "text": "On jouait aux cartes à une table, un groupe lançait des fléchettes sur une cible peinte représentant des bâtiments silhouettés maladroitement, une usine, ou peut-être une centrale nucléaire."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dbd84f77-8486-3f11-aacf-00632fbb0ab7",
                        "entry_id": "ec336316-36e5-3fc8-aafa-c925bf61e72d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Jeu d’adresse consistant à lancer manuellement ce type de projectiles vers une cible."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7bf8eb6e-6d92-4f01-bdc1-63174c9dda68",
                                "sense_id": "dbd84f77-8486-3f11-aacf-00632fbb0ab7",
                                "text": "Les joueurs de fléchettes romarimontains du club Dart'istes vont tenter de conserver leur titre national ce week-end, à domicile."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf9a630b-2266-4f6d-9361-2de31a564380",
                                "sense_id": "dbd84f77-8486-3f11-aacf-00632fbb0ab7",
                                "text": "La concentration est de mise durant tout ce week-end au palais des congrès de Remiremont, qui accueille pour la deuxième année en trois ans les masters nationaux par équipes de fléchettes traditionnelles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d16199f-feda-462e-9d8e-c19e8731d0b0",
                                "sense_id": "dbd84f77-8486-3f11-aacf-00632fbb0ab7",
                                "text": "De l’intérieur, la grange ressemblait à une sorte de campement clandestin : une table Quechua, une mini-gazinière Quechua, un vieux frigo posé sur une palette branchée à une longue rallonge, un hamac rayé de jaune, de rose et de rouge tendu entre deux piliers de bois marron foncé, une tente bleue (Quechua encore), et une vieille cible jaune et noire accrochée à la grande porte de bois dans laquelle était planté un jeu de fléchettes rouges et bleues."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "33ccc5de-851a-3fd0-bfdc-59b59bf5cc4a",
                        "entry_id": "ec336316-36e5-3fc8-aafa-c925bf61e72d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Petites flèches métalliques lancées sur les ennemis par les avions."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cbfd395e-6576-30b7-bc6d-97897152d622",
                        "entry_id": "ec336316-36e5-3fc8-aafa-c925bf61e72d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Dose de pot belge."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8d431e6-67e6-4674-ab7f-1161831d4fa0",
                                "sense_id": "cbfd395e-6576-30b7-bc6d-97897152d622",
                                "text": "Il fut très difficile à Willy Voet d’expliquer que tout cela était pour sa consommation personnelle. D’autant que s’il ne crachait pas sur une fléchette de pot belge pour conduire la nuit, il ne courait pas le Tour et n’avait pas vraiment besoin de se doper."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7e114215-24de-3a6c-84b8-e9c9c74a3a84",
                        "entry_id": "ec336316-36e5-3fc8-aafa-c925bf61e72d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Plus petite récompense dans l'épreuve de ski alpin de la flèche (slalom géant), organisée par l'école de ski français."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "France"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c35c1b69-b8aa-4179-ace4-a5b751256b92",
                                "sense_id": "7e114215-24de-3a6c-84b8-e9c9c74a3a84",
                                "text": "Chantal passe avec succès la flèche : « 30 décembre 1976. Demain, je passe la flèche, étant donné que j'ai déjà la fléchette, je serai dans les 20 premiers sur 70 comme c'est classé par ordre de force, de capacité. Bonne chance je me souhaite, comme la providence le souhaite. »"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "318af0ee-4118-4202-a2e1-72a519e6b890",
                        "source_entry_id": "ec336316-36e5-3fc8-aafa-c925bf61e72d",
                        "source_sense_description": "Petite flèche",
                        "target_lang_word": "dart",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dart",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "019e0893-70a0-3ccb-a472-857b91e7f7a7",
                                        "entry_id": "74429214-4309-3fe8-9519-2878b1b387de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pointed missile weapon, intended to be thrown by the hand; for example, a short lance or javelin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1382a039-d8a2-4e12-b19d-e255aafebc40",
                                                "sense_id": "019e0893-70a0-3ccb-a472-857b91e7f7a7",
                                                "text": "Then said Joab, I may not tarry thus with thee. And he took three darts in his hand, and thrust them through the heart of Absalom, while he was yet alive in the midst of the oak."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "164e1f0d-00f6-32b5-8275-6657094836cb",
                                        "entry_id": "74429214-4309-3fe8-9519-2878b1b387de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any sharp-pointed missile weapon, such as an arrow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e08cdd2c-8529-32bf-b07f-592026fa3462",
                                        "entry_id": "74429214-4309-3fe8-9519-2878b1b387de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything resembling such a missile; something that pierces or wounds like such a weapon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16f66d08-d23a-4b9d-8036-4e6d895cdc50",
                                                "sense_id": "e08cdd2c-8529-32bf-b07f-592026fa3462",
                                                "text": "The artful inquiry, whose venom′d dart / Scarce wounds the hearing while it stabs the heart."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66264e99-c1cb-370a-bdd1-9d9f0ef30d60",
                                        "entry_id": "74429214-4309-3fe8-9519-2878b1b387de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small object with a pointed tip at one end and feathers at the other, which is thrown at a target in the game of darts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c741aa1-a1f8-3517-95b7-edc0e9b92548",
                                        "entry_id": "74429214-4309-3fe8-9519-2878b1b387de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cigarette."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "Canada",
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aec91aed-2b64-438f-b346-302250286ab7",
                                                "sense_id": "7c741aa1-a1f8-3517-95b7-edc0e9b92548",
                                                "text": "2017, April 18, Craig Little, The Guardian, Hawthorn are not the only ones finding that things can get worse\nThe Tigers will also face Jesse Hogan, still smarting from missing a couple of games but not life inside the AFL bubble, where you can’t even light up a dart at a music festival without someone filming it and sending it to the six o’clock news."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76a2cf67-68ba-3463-9944-86ccaf11915d",
                                        "entry_id": "74429214-4309-3fe8-9519-2878b1b387de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dart-shaped target towed behind an aircraft to train shooters."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de35339e-0564-48cd-a885-69f89b7a44d2",
                                                "sense_id": "76a2cf67-68ba-3463-9944-86ccaf11915d",
                                                "text": "Fighter aircraft also use restricted areas for target shooting at darts towed 1500 feet behind another aircraft."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfb5d719-97ac-3b15-9f7c-403120d2f38f",
                                        "entry_id": "74429214-4309-3fe8-9519-2878b1b387de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A plan or scheme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0fcc0aa-0410-49b1-9782-527d164baf99",
                                                "sense_id": "bfb5d719-97ac-3b15-9f7c-403120d2f38f",
                                                "text": "Trucking′s my dart too."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa21ca11-0d52-3ca4-ba3f-89787852dc27",
                                        "entry_id": "74429214-4309-3fe8-9519-2878b1b387de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sudden or fast movement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d0ddcbc-f001-4b40-b28e-7bb270bb0029",
                                                "sense_id": "aa21ca11-0d52-3ca4-ba3f-89787852dc27",
                                                "text": "Soon as I felt the floor tremor I made a dart for the door."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe2e25a2-857a-4b68-bedf-42d5ddd377fd",
                                                "sense_id": "aa21ca11-0d52-3ca4-ba3f-89787852dc27",
                                                "text": "Six minutes later Cueto went over for his second try after the recalled Mike Tindall found him with a perfectly-timed pass, before Ashton went on another dart, this time down his opposite wing, only for his speculative pass inside to be ruled forward."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d98f76fa-813c-3b9c-9bc1-04d4edebaaac",
                                        "entry_id": "74429214-4309-3fe8-9519-2878b1b387de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fold that is stitched on a garment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd06567d-c806-467f-a3ff-6348ffad729d",
                                                "sense_id": "d98f76fa-813c-3b9c-9bc1-04d4edebaaac",
                                                "text": "Somehow she managed, with a cinched waist here and a few darts there, to look like a Hollywood star."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e653c18f-05f8-3c9f-a984-0934ac2d1c28",
                                        "entry_id": "74429214-4309-3fe8-9519-2878b1b387de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dace (fish) (Leuciscus leuciscus)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3574ee0-0855-3da8-9912-95bf39431729",
                                        "entry_id": "74429214-4309-3fe8-9519-2878b1b387de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various species of hesperiid butterfly."
                                        ],
